@prefix med: <http://www.semanticweb.org/medsemantic#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

med:Patient a rdfs:Class .
med:ConditionMedicale a rdfs:Class .
med:EtatPhysiologique rdfs:subClassOf med:ConditionMedicale .
med:EtatPathologique rdfs:subClassOf med:ConditionMedicale .
med:Grossesse rdfs:subClassOf med:EtatPhysiologique .
med:InsuffisanceRenale rdfs:subClassOf med:EtatPathologique .
med:InsuffisanceHepatique rdfs:subClassOf med:EtatPathologique .
med:Allergie rdfs:subClassOf med:EtatPathologique .

med:Patient_Sarah a med:Patient ; med:age 8 ; med:sexe "F" ; med:prend med:Doliprane ; med:ressentSymptome med:Fievre .
med:Patient_Karim a med:Patient ; med:age 45 ; med:sexe "M" ; med:prend med:Glucophage ; med:aPourMaladie med:DiabeteType2 .
med:Patient_Fatma a med:Patient ; med:age 72 ; med:sexe "F" ; med:prend med:Amlor ; med:aPourMaladie med:Hypertension .

med:Grossesse_T3 a med:Grossesse ; med:severite "3e trimestre" .
med:InsufRenaleSevere a med:InsuffisanceRenale ; med:severite "sévère" .
med:InsufHepatiqueModeree a med:InsuffisanceHepatique ; med:severite "modérée" .
med:AllergiePenicilline a med:Allergie .
